-- Which home am I treated as normally occupying after leaving because of fear of violence (Sch 3 para 6)?
-- Sch 3 para 6(2): every condition met, and 31 December 2025 is within 12 months of 1 January 2025.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: I am living in accommodation other than my home = TRUE; it is unreasonable to expect me to return because of a reasonable fear of violence = TRUE; I intend to return to my home = TRUE; I meet the payment and liability conditions for my home = TRUE; I meet the payment and liability conditions for the other accommodation = TRUE; it is reasonable to include an amount for my home in the housing costs element = TRUE; it is reasonable to include an amount for the other accommodation in the housing costs element = TRUE; the month of the day I am asking about = 12; the day of the month of the day I am asking about = 31.
#ASSERT `Which home am I treated as normally occupying after leaving because of fear of violence` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 2025 1 1 2025 12 31 EQUALS `both the home accommodation and the other accommodation`
-- Sch 3 para 6(4): 1 January 2026 is 12 months after 1 January 2025; the text does not say what then applies (fork U3-F20).
-- Inputs other than the defaults: I am living in accommodation other than my home = TRUE; it is unreasonable to expect me to return because of a reasonable fear of violence = TRUE; I intend to return to my home = TRUE; I meet the payment and liability conditions for my home = TRUE; I meet the payment and liability conditions for the other accommodation = TRUE; it is reasonable to include an amount for my home in the housing costs element = TRUE; it is reasonable to include an amount for the other accommodation in the housing costs element = TRUE; the year of the day I am asking about = 2026.
#ASSERT `Which home am I treated as normally occupying after leaving because of fear of violence` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 2025 1 1 2026 1 1 EQUALS `not covered: the text does not say which accommodation the claimant is treated as occupying once the 12 months of paragraph 6(4) have passed`
-- Sch 3 para 6(3): the conditions are met for the home accommodation only, and it is reasonable to include an amount for it.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: I am living in accommodation other than my home = TRUE; it is unreasonable to expect me to return because of a reasonable fear of violence = TRUE; I intend to return to my home = TRUE; I meet the payment and liability conditions for my home = TRUE; it is reasonable to include an amount for my home in the housing costs element = TRUE.
#ASSERT `Which home am I treated as normally occupying after leaving because of fear of violence` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE 2025 1 1 2025 1 1 EQUALS `the home accommodation only`
-- Sch 3 para 6(3): the conditions are met for the other accommodation only, and it is reasonable.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: I am living in accommodation other than my home = TRUE; it is unreasonable to expect me to return because of a reasonable fear of violence = TRUE; I intend to return to my home = TRUE; I meet the payment and liability conditions for the other accommodation = TRUE; it is reasonable to include an amount for the other accommodation in the housing costs element = TRUE.
#ASSERT `Which home am I treated as normally occupying after leaving because of fear of violence` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE 2025 1 1 2025 1 1 EQUALS `the other accommodation only`
-- Sch 3 para 6(1) is not met (no fear of violence, no intention to return), so the paragraph does not apply.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: I meet the payment and liability conditions for my home = TRUE; it is reasonable to include an amount for my home in the housing costs element = TRUE.
#ASSERT `Which home am I treated as normally occupying after leaving because of fear of violence` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE 2025 1 1 2025 1 1 EQUALS `neither: paragraph 6 does not treat the claimant as occupying either`

