-- Am I treated as no longer living in my home because of a long temporary absence (Sch 3 para 9)?
-- Sch 3 para 9(1): an absence from 1 January to 30 June has lasted exactly 6 months and does not exceed them (fork U3-F8).
-- Inputs other than the defaults: the month of the day I am asking about = 6; the day of the month of the day I am asking about = 30; the month of the last day my absence is expected to last = 6; the day of the month of the last day my absence is expected to last = 30.
#ASSERT `Am I treated as no longer living in my home because of a long temporary absence` 2025 1 1 2025 6 30 2025 6 30 FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- Sch 3 para 9(1): by 1 July the absence exceeds 6 months.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: the month of the day I am asking about = 7; the month of the last day my absence is expected to last = 7.
#ASSERT `Am I treated as no longer living in my home because of a long temporary absence` 2025 1 1 2025 7 1 2025 7 1 FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- Sch 3 para 9(1): the absence is expected to exceed 6 months.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: the month of the day I am asking about = 3; the month of the last day my absence is expected to last = 8.
#ASSERT `Am I treated as no longer living in my home because of a long temporary absence` 2025 1 1 2025 3 1 2025 8 1 FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- Sch 3 para 9(2): paragraph 9(1) does not apply to a claimant who falls within paragraph 3.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: the month of the day I am asking about = 7; the month of the last day my absence is expected to last = 7; I fall within paragraph 3 of Schedule 3 = TRUE.
#ASSERT `Am I treated as no longer living in my home because of a long temporary absence` 2025 1 1 2025 7 1 2025 7 1 TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- Sch 3 para 9(3): a claimant within paragraph 6 is treated as no longer occupying only where the absence exceeds 12 months; 1 January to 31 December has not.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: the month of the day I am asking about = 12; the day of the month of the day I am asking about = 31; the month of the last day my absence is expected to last = 12; the day of the month of the last day my absence is expected to last = 31; I fall within paragraph 6 of Schedule 3 = TRUE.
#ASSERT `Am I treated as no longer living in my home because of a long temporary absence` 2025 1 1 2025 12 31 2025 12 31 FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- Sch 3 para 9(3): by 1 January 2026 the absence exceeds 12 months.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: the year of the day I am asking about = 2026; the year of the last day my absence is expected to last = 2026; I fall within paragraph 6 of Schedule 3 = TRUE.
#ASSERT `Am I treated as no longer living in my home because of a long temporary absence` 2025 1 1 2026 1 1 2026 1 1 FALSE TRUE EQUALS TRUE

