#ASSERT `Is what I pay taken into account for my housing costs element` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- What is the monthly equivalent of what I pay (Sch 4 para 7)?
-- Sch 4 para 7(2)(a): weekly payments are multiplied by 52 and divided by 12: 12 x 52 / 12.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: the amount of each payment = 12; how often the payment falls due = `weekly payments`.
#ASSERT `What is the monthly equivalent of what I pay` 12 `weekly payments` FALSE 0 EQUALS 52
-- Sch 4 para 7(2)(b): four-weekly payments are multiplied by 13 and divided by 12: 12 x 13 / 12.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: the amount of each payment = 12; how often the payment falls due = `four-weekly payments`.
#ASSERT `What is the monthly equivalent of what I pay` 12 `four-weekly payments` FALSE 0 EQUALS 13
-- Sch 4 para 7(2)(c): three-monthly payments are multiplied by 4 and divided by 12: 300 x 4 / 12.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: the amount of each payment = 300; how often the payment falls due = `three-monthly payments`.
#ASSERT `What is the monthly equivalent of what I pay` 300 `three-monthly payments` FALSE 0 EQUALS 100
-- Sch 4 para 7(2)(d): annual payments are divided by 12.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: the amount of each payment = 1200; how often the payment falls due = `annual payments`.
#ASSERT `What is the monthly equivalent of what I pay` 1200 `annual payments` FALSE 0 EQUALS 100
-- Sch 4 para 7(1): a monthly payment is its own monthly amount.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: the amount of each payment = 500.
#ASSERT `What is the monthly equivalent of what I pay` 500 `monthly payments` FALSE 0 EQUALS 500
-- Sch 4 para 7(3): with rent free periods the monthly equivalent is worked over 12 months from the number of payments: 600 x 10 / 12.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: the amount of each payment = 600; my arrangements provide for rent free periods = TRUE; the total number of payments in the 12 month period = 10.
#ASSERT `What is the monthly equivalent of what I pay` 600 `monthly payments` TRUE 10 EQUALS 500

