#ASSERT `Is my temporarily absent child or qualifying young person still counted in my extended benefit unit` 2025 6 30 2025 1 1 FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- Sch 4 para 11(2)(c): before the renter ceases to be responsible under regulation 4(7).
