-- How much will be deducted because I have more bedrooms than I am entitled to (Sch 4 para 36)?
-- Sch 4 para 36(2), (3): one excess bedroom, 14% of 500.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: the number of bedrooms in my home = 3; the number of bedrooms I am entitled to = 2; the monthly total of my relevant payments = 500.
#ASSERT `How much will be deducted because I have more bedrooms than I am entitled to` 3 FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 2 500 EQUALS 70
