-- Sch 5 para 3: not a payment for services or facilities.
-- Inputs: all at their defaults.
#ASSERT `Is what I pay a relevant payment for the housing costs element of an owner-occupier` England FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE

