-- Inputs other than the defaults: I have limited capability for work and work-related activity = TRUE; my award of universal credit includes the LCWRA element = TRUE; I have been so entitled continuously since the LCWRA element was included = TRUE; before 6 April 2026 I had limited capability for work and work-related activity = TRUE; before 6 April 2026 my award did not include the LCWRA element by virtue of regulation 28(1) = TRUE; on or after 6 April 2026 the LCWRA element was included in my award = TRUE.
#ASSERT `Am I a pre-2026 claimant for the LCWRA element` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- Sch 5A paras 1 and 5: entitled before 6 April 2026 to an employment and support allowance with the support component, and so entitled throughout.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: I have limited capability for work and work-related activity = TRUE; my award of universal credit includes the LCWRA element = TRUE; I have been so entitled continuously since the LCWRA element was included = TRUE; before 6 April 2026 I was entitled to an employment and support allowance that included the support component = TRUE; I have been so entitled throughout from 6 April 2026 to the date I was awarded universal credit that includes the LCWRA element = TRUE.
#ASSERT `Am I a pre-2026 claimant for the LCWRA element` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- Sch 5A para 1(a): none of paragraphs 2 to 5 applies.
