#ASSERT `Am I a pre-2026 claimant for the LCWRA element` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- Sch 5A para 1: the claimant does not have limited capability for work and work-related activity.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: my award of universal credit includes the LCWRA element = TRUE; I have been so entitled continuously since the LCWRA element was included = TRUE; before 6 April 2026 I was awaiting an assessment under Part 5 (regulation 41(1)(a)) = TRUE; on or after 6 April 2026 I was found to have LCWRA and entitled to an award that includes the LCWRA element (case 2) = TRUE.
#ASSERT `Am I a pre-2026 claimant for the LCWRA element` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- Sch 5A para 1: not continuously entitled since the element was included.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: I have limited capability for work and work-related activity = TRUE; my award of universal credit includes the LCWRA element = TRUE; before 6 April 2026 I was awaiting an assessment under Part 5 (regulation 41(1)(a)) = TRUE; on or after 6 April 2026 I was found to have LCWRA and entitled to an award that includes the LCWRA element (case 2) = TRUE.
#ASSERT `Am I a pre-2026 claimant for the LCWRA element` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- Sch 5A para 2(b): the day on or after 6 April 2026 is missing.
-- Inputs other than the defaults: I have limited capability for work and work-related activity = TRUE; my award of universal credit includes the LCWRA element = TRUE; I have been so entitled continuously since the LCWRA element was included = TRUE; before 6 April 2026 I was awaiting an assessment under Part 5 (regulation 41(1)(a)) = TRUE.
#ASSERT `Am I a pre-2026 claimant for the LCWRA element` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
